  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c27b3ab3c8@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker (NYSE:SYK) announced today that it has priced the following notes: (i) €550 million aggregate principal amount of the Company’s 1.125% Notes due 2023 (the “2023 Notes”), (ii) €750 million aggregate principal amount of the Company’s 2.125% Notes due 2027 (the “2027 Notes”), (iii) €650 million aggregate principal amount of the Company’s 2.625% Notes due 2030 (the “2030 Notes”) and (iv) €300 million aggregate principal amount of the Company’s Floating Rate Notes due 2020 (the “Floating Rate Notes” and together with the 2023 Notes, 2027 Notes and 2030 Notes, the “Notes”).&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>See full press release <a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2018/Stryker-announces-pricing-of-225-billion-senior-notes-offering/default.aspx\">here</a></p>\n",
